      x: '<p><b>will</b> barcha shaxslarda bir xil, keyin fe’l <b>to siz</b>. Ishlatilishi:</p><p>• aniq bo‘lmagan bashorat, fikr: <b>I think</b> it<b>’ll</b> rain. <b>Perhaps</b> she<b>’ll</b> come. (hope, think, believe, expect, I’m sure, probably bilan)<br>• shu lahzadagi qaror: The phone’s ringing. — I<b>’ll</b> answer it!<br>• taklif, va’da: I<b>’ll</b> help you. I <b>won’t</b> tell anyone.</p>',
