      x: '<p><b>because</b> — «chunki, … uchun». <b>Why?</b> savoliga javob beradi. Undan keyin to‘liq gap (ega + fe’l) keladi. Agar faqat ot bo‘lsa — <b>because of</b>: We stayed home <b>because of</b> the rain.</p>',
